  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Child Protection, GBV and Prevention of Sexual Exploitation and Abuse Needs in Volta Flooding Response.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing GBV, child safeguarding, and SEA directly. A code of ethics for caseworkers will be enforced, training will be offered on child safeguarding, and the Case Management SOPs and national referral pathways will be used throughout the case management process to ensure the best interest of a child and do no harm principles.</narrative>
  </description>
